    "enUS": {
      "description": "These hides are to be delivered to Powderfuse Port. It is a goblin-run port to the northeast.\r\n\r\nWhen you get there, deliver the hides to Friz Frazzlespark. Tell her they're from Cornelius. The details of our trade have already been worked out, so she'll know what they are for.",
      "dialogue": {
        "c4fbbf4a3a78e15e684f": "Whaddya got for me?"
      },
      "summary": "Deliver the Bundle of Lion Hides to Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port.",
